%
( Z CALIBRATION SWEEP  -  AIR ONLY, MOVES Z ONLY, SPINDLE OFF                   )
( Optional data grab for the Z phase: docs/handoffs/2026-11-11-z-vernier-plan.md )
( Start "capture.sh 330 OUT.txt z" first, then run this. About 5 minutes.        )
( Z travels from ZS toward the chuck to ZS - 1.0 and back, slowly, at three     )
( feeds, then makes ten short back-and-forth reversals for backlash.           )
( X never moves. Set ZS so there is 1.0 of clear Z travel below it with the    )
( tool where X is now, nothing in the chuck in the way.                        )
#<zs> = 0.0000
#<span> = 1.0000
N10 G20 G7 G18 G90 G94 G40 G49 G80
N20 M5
N30 G00 Z[#<zs>]
N40 G04 P1.0
( three speeds: slow edges for the map, faster ones for drive lag )
N50 G01 Z[#<zs> - #<span>] F1.0
N60 G04 P0.5
N70 G01 Z[#<zs>] F1.0
N80 G04 P0.5
N90 G01 Z[#<zs> - #<span>] F2.0
N100 G04 P0.5
N110 G01 Z[#<zs>] F2.0
N120 G04 P0.5
N130 G01 Z[#<zs> - #<span>] F3.0
N140 G04 P0.5
N150 G01 Z[#<zs>] F3.0
N160 G04 P0.5
( backlash: ten .010 reversals, stepping toward the chuck .020 each time )
#<i> = 0
o100 while [#<i> LT 10]
  G01 Z[#<zs> - 0.020 * #<i> - 0.010] F1.0
  G04 P0.3
  G01 Z[#<zs> - 0.020 * #<i>] F1.0
  G04 P0.3
  #<i> = [#<i> + 1]
o100 endwhile
N900 G00 Z[#<zs>]
N910 M2
%
